{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{S}_i$", "MATH_0003": "$i = 1, 2, 3, 4$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\varphi : \\mathcal{S}_1 \\to \\mathcal{S}_2$", "MATH_0006": "$\\psi : \\mathcal{S}_3 \\to \\mathcal{S}_4$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "MATH_0008": "$$\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Cat}/\\mathcal{C}}(\\mathcal{S}_2, \\mathcal{S}_3)\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Mor_{\\textit{Cat}/\\mathcal{C}}(\\mathcal{S}_1, \\mathcal{S}_4),\n\\quad \\alpha \\longmapsto \\psi \\circ \\alpha \\circ \\varphi\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-morphisms-equivalent-fibred-groupoids}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:66769b1a52cf34b8d558bdf7ea3b38a0a52256c7b81d39130e6cae4754159c4c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2aac7f55ded0edbc712578ea49da03f4e0e2d5ebca827d67dc646fa0b8768b4d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a category.\nLet <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003> be categories fibred in\ngroupoids over <MATH_0004>.\nSuppose that <MATH_0005> and\n<MATH_0006> are equivalences\nover <MATH_0007>. Then\n<MATH_0008>\nis an equivalence of categories.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4016f61f846807589ceec73856d0e21da7d6eb43759766ea7cc6a626af2af77e", "unit_id": "tag:03YT:statement"}
{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "003S", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$2$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b15315ec3c2fa7b154c0d17c24b63d47f12b572ea3fa602a460510e1a685b882", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:3714cd6dbdb9265459c73f8cdc3f9dfb590366aa8d25ddae6a836e268a85d799", "source_text": "This is a generality and holds in any <MATH_0001>-category.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:05d7ee0831f4498516adbd6bbddf2d974057e8609d8554e5ec4b4882b9274c5f", "unit_id": "tag:03YT:proof"}
